#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:109
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:112
msgid ""
"Enable the following options in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo,"
" se necessário:"

#.  Editor note: CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU_SI available in 4.9+
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:117
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<literal>Device Drivers  ---&gt;\n"
"  Graphics support ---&gt;\n"
"   &lt;*&gt; Direct Rendering Manager (XFree86 ... support) ---&gt; [CONFIG_DRM]\n"
"   &lt;*/M&gt; AMD GPU                                           [CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU]\n"
"    &lt; /*&gt; Enable amdgpu support for SI parts               [CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU_SI]\n"
"    &lt; /*&gt; Enable amdgpu support for CIK parts              [CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU_CIK]</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>Device Drivers  ---&gt;\n"
"  Graphics support ---&gt;\n"
"   &lt;*&gt; Direct Rendering Manager (XFree86 ... support) ---&gt; [CONFIG_DRM]\n"
"   &lt;*/M&gt; AMD GPU                                          [CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU]\n"
"    &lt; /*&gt; Enable amdgpu support for SI parts               [CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU_SI]\n"
"    &lt; /*&gt; Enable amdgpu support for CIK parts              [CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU_CIK]</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:125
msgid ""
"The last two options enable experimental support for Southern and Sea "
"Islands AMD GPUs so they can be used with this driver. Note that the support"
" is marked experimental and disabled by default.  <xref linkend=\"xorg-ati-"
"driver\"/> should be used for those GPUs."
msgstr ""
"As últimas duas opções habilitam o suporte experimental para as "
"&quot;GPUs&quot; &quot;Southern Islands&quot; e &quot;Sea Islands&quot; da "
"&quot;AMD&quot;, de forma que possam ser usadas com esse controlador. "
"Observe que o suporte está marcado como experimental e desabilitado por "
"padrão. O &quot;<xref linkend=\"xorg-ati-driver\"/>&quot; deveria ser usado "
"para essas &quot;GPUs&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:137
msgid "Kernel Configuration for additional firmware"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo para <quote>firmware</quote> adicional"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:140
msgid ""
"If you need to add firmware, install the file(s) and then point to them in "
"the kernel configuration and recompile the kernel if necessary. To find out "
"which firmware you need, consult the <ulink url=\"&radeon-marketing-"
"names;\"> Decoder ring for engineering vs marketing names</ulink>. Download "
"any firmware for your card which is named like: "
"<filename><replaceable>&lt;ENGINEERING_NAME&gt;</replaceable>_rlc.bin</filename>,"
" etc. Below is an example for Radeon R7 M340 GPU, which is codenamed "
"Iceland/Topaz, along with a network card that also requires the firmware:"
msgstr ""
"Se você precisar adicionar &quot;firmware&quot;, [então] instale o(s) "
"arquivo(s) e então aponte para ele(s) na configuração do núcleo e recompile "
"o núcleo se necessário. Para descobrir qual &quot;firmware&quot; você "
"precisa, consulte o &quot;<ulink url=\"&radeon-marketing-names;\">Anel "
"decodificador para nomes de engenharia versus nomes de "
"mercadologia</ulink>&quot;. Baixe qualquer &quot;firmware&quot; para a tua "
"placa com o nome: "
"&quot;<filename><replaceable>&lt;NOME_ENGENHARIA&gt;</replaceable>_rlc.bin</filename>&quot;,"
" etc. Abaixo está um exemplo para a &quot;GPU&quot; &quot;Radeon R7 "
"M340&quot;, cujo codinome é &quot;Iceland/Topaz&quot;, junto com uma placa "
"de rede de intercomunicação que também exige o &quot;firmware&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<literal>CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE=\"amdgpu/topaz_ce.bin amdgpu/topaz_k_smc.bin amdgpu/topaz_mc.bin\n"
"                       amdgpu/topaz_me.bin amdgpu/topaz_mec2.bin amdgpu/topaz_mec.bin\n"
"                       amdgpu/topaz_pfp.bin amdgpu/topaz_rlc.bin amdgpu/topaz_sdma1.bin\n"
"                       amdgpu/topaz_sdma.bin amdgpu/topaz_smc.bin rtl_nic/rtl8168e-3.fw\"\n"
"CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR=\"/lib/firmware\"</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE=\"amdgpu/topaz_ce.bin amdgpu/topaz_k_smc.bin amdgpu/topaz_mc.bin\n"
"                        amdgpu/topaz_me.bin amdgpu/topaz_mec2.bin amdgpu/topaz_mec.bin\n"
"                        amdgpu/topaz_pfp.bin amdgpu/topaz_rlc.bin amdgpu/topaz_sdma1.bin\n"
"                        amdgpu/topaz_sdma.bin amdgpu/topaz_smc.bin rtl_nic/rtl8168e-3.fw\"\n"
"CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR=\"/lib/firmware\"</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:158
msgid ""
"CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE should all be on one line. It is shown above as "
"multiple lines for presentation only."
msgstr ""
"CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE deveria estar todos em uma linha. É mostrado acima "
"como múltiplas linhas somente para apresentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:165
msgid ""
"You can check <command>dmesg</command> output after boot to see which "
"firmware is missing."
msgstr ""
"Você pode verificar a saída gerada do &quot;<command>dmesg</command>&quot; "
"depois da inicialização para ver qual &quot;firmware&quot; está ausente."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:171
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you change CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU to '=m' in your linux kernel "
".config the firmware can be loaded automatically from /lib/firmware/amdgpu/ "
"when it installs the module. This offers a tiny space saving, but also means"
" that the screen will be blank for a longer time before the framebuffer "
"appears. Distros take this approach because it is not practical to specify "
"every possible firmware and the kernel would be excessively big."
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, se você mudar &quot;CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU&quot; para "
"&quot;=m&quot; no &quot;.config&quot; do teu núcleo Linux, [então] o "
"&quot;firmware&quot; consegue ser carregado automaticamente a partir de "
"&quot;/lib/firmware/amdgpu/&quot; quando instalar o módulo. Isso oferece uma"
" pequena economia de espaço, mas também significa que a tela ficará em "
"branco por mais tempo antes que o &quot;framebuffer&quot; apareça. As "
"distribuições adotam essa abordagem porque não é prático especificar todos "
"os &quot;firmwares&quot; possíveis e o núcleo seria excessivamente grande."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:181
msgid "xorg-amdgpu-firmware"
msgstr "xorg-amdgpu-firmware"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:186
msgid "Installation of Xorg AMDGPU Driver"
msgstr ""
"Instalação do Controlador <quote>AMDGPU</quote> do <quote>Xorg</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:189
msgid ""
"Install <application>Xorg AMDGPU Driver</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Controlador &quot;AMDGPU&quot; do "
"&quot;Xorg&quot;</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:193
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:197
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:201
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-amdgpu.xml:204
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

